 a reminder that death lurked around every corner in wartime. But it was also a moment of reverence, a testament to the bond that formed between sailors on the high seas. As the pyre burned, the crew of the HMS Buttercup stood in silence, their faces lit by the flickering flames. It was a moment that would stay with Tom for the rest of his life, a moment that would remind him of the sacrifices made by those who served on the front lines. And as the ashes dispersed into the wind, carried away by the sea breeze, Tom couldn't help but feel a sense of pride and purpose. He was part of something bigger than himself, something that transcended the boundaries of life and death. He was part of the HMS Buttercup, a ship that had borne witness to the horrors of war, and had emerged stronger because of it."}], "fallible_prior": ["World War I"], "prior_explanation": "HMS Buttercup was a British sloop involved in World War I, primarily used for anti-submarine warfare and convoy escort duties.", "fallible_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "HMS Buttercup", "scope": "event", "claim": "HMS Buttercup was involved in escorting a convoy of merchant ships across the North Atlantic during the war.", "answer": "HMS Buttercup was involved in escorting a convoy of merchant ships across the North Atlantic during the war.", "quote": "As the HMS Buttercup cut through the choppy waters of the North Atlantic, its crew of seasoned sailors and young recruits alike stood vigilant, scanning the horizon for any sign of the enemy. It was a chilly autumn morning in 1941, and the war was raging on. The Flower-class corvette, with its distinctive stern and sleek hull, had been tasked with escorting a convoy of merchant ships across the treacherous waters.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "HMS Buttercup", "scope": "event", "claim": "HMS Buttercup was involved in the cremation of Lieutenant Thompson at sea.", "answer": "HMS Buttercup was